{"id":"cnyvung6ekyb2v42p1sit4ps7","title":"美联储等机构延长第三方风险管理指导意见征求意见期","originalTitle":"Agencies extend comment period for proposed third-party risk management guidance","summary":"美联储、联邦存款保险公司、全国信用联盟管理局和货币监理署宣布将第三方风险管理指导意见的征求意见期延长至12月16日，原定截止日期为11月16日。该指导意见旨在帮助银行和信用联盟根据第三方关系的风险调整风险管理实践。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"美联储新闻稿"},"links":{"original":"https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/bcreg20261113a.htm"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T21:15:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T22:01:30.204Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T22:01:30.204Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚","政策发布"],"score":39,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}